# Repository Instructions

Apply @.github/copilot-instructions.md as the canonical repository instructions for every
Cursor Agent chat.

When those instructions refer to build-time coding-agent skills under `.github/skills/`, use
the matching skill under `.cursor/skills/`. Cursor-specific skill references and commands must
use `.cursor/skills/`; keep all other skill content synchronized with `.github/skills/`.